Subject: [PATCH] Reuse the UID observer dispatcher with the host process authority

The diagnostic ActiveUids mirror imports the full AMS process graph but does
not determine delivered callbacks. Omit that mirror and its private diagnostic
entry points. Retain UidRecord's event bits, all registration/filter behavior,
coalescing, callback order, cutpoints and death-recipient ownership. Dispatch
filter changes on the existing Handler without AMS-specific message codes.

